{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"8bd7d1be0809dd7c8654a5457029e330337ed258f12381f168ebda3eb48aa59d","ja":"（今日はまだ誰にも厳しくできてないな……。\nこのままだと『人に厳しく週間』が続けられないかも）","zh":"（今天还没能对谁严格起来呢……。\n这样下去的话，『对人严格周』可能就坚持不下去了）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f31929ce8ba9af4bb981331aca2d19934fedd016f90b03ffe235c0a8f40772eb","ja":"風花ちゃん、そろそろ姫たちの出番……。","zh":"小风花，差不多该公主们上场了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f2e10c0cf5725a0a970747588235b24eae4c0227f38a97134ae8aa0f9700ab63","ja":"ほ？　どうしたのです？\nなんだか浮かない顔をしているのですよ？","zh":"哦？怎么了？\n总觉得你一脸闷闷不乐的呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fcf24909808fc132c2605ca3f3c841cdc0e522c2bc3ad79a5dc799c8bb7f3863","ja":"（まつりちゃんに厳しくするとか……？）","zh":"（对小祭严厉一点……？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a6d1a53e9dca55f3ad69c99339d8fafb7e27d87cb69aa4e820c140c35f359185","ja":"（でも身だしなみもバッチリだし、\n変なことしたわけでもないし……え～っと……）","zh":"（不过仪容也很得体，\n也没做什么奇怪的事……嗯……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"df4239c83e61fdce04a329757996043cabf930d8b12ba9d514fa2eb9a7a26ad7","ja":"姫に言いたいことがあるのです？\n……風花ちゃん！！","zh":"你有什么话要对公主说吗？\n……风花！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"6488274743f30a57e14fdbe290170a18b2e401b481a7e3c40adf7dfe98b7d027","ja":"えっ！？　ええっと、その……あっ。","zh":"咦！？　那个……啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"8bff586faaf1b4e31bfffdbed3bfae5fd577425d593dcd9a29dee2340568cb00","ja":"え、襟がほんの少し曲がってるなって……！\nみみ、身だしなみは、きちんとしないと、でしょ？","zh":"诶，衣领有点歪了啊……！\n美美，仪容仪表得好好整理才行，对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f5f90e5f5213067a31b2ecf6650f69aad2976f45a4781f2129a81d76a7db6e2d","ja":"……風花ちゃん、\nなんだか無理をしているのですよ？","zh":"……风花，\n总觉得你在勉强自己呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"30ad2982c999e69ba622ef048a97818f4b3bd913aa6ea42d50fce36d663b719f","ja":"うっ。や、やっぱり？\n私も、そうかもって、思ってはいたんだけど……。","zh":"呜。果、果然？\n我也觉得也许是那样，不过……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"81b57e391f222be739ec9f600363277cfd6bb73315f0d59b233e5e6fda61e21c","ja":"『人に厳しく週間』のことは、姫も聞いているのです。\nでも風花ちゃんには合わないのですよ。","zh":"“严于待人周”的事，公主也有听说哦。\n不过这并不适合风花呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"9e1408acdd257b98512deb08acf11190a49b2545b4d27c2ee3a3bbd528f67d64","ja":"役作りが必要になったら、その時は\n姫が協力するのです。だから……ね？","zh":"要是需要揣摩角色的话，到时\n公主会来帮忙的。所以……好吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1411.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"114db3cac24000e753ceb438a862947cafb9279b99cbf91c16eb1e2eab60c86b","ja":"ううっ、そうね……。\nありがとう、まつりちゃん。その時はよろしくね。","zh":"呜呜，说得也是……。\n谢谢你，小祭。到时候就拜托你了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
